    "detailed_description": "Drugs and Crime Idle is a free, offline, idle game about selling drugs and building your criminal empire.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nProduce drugs and upgrade your dealers. Attack with your thugs and generate CrimeCoin, which you can spend on opening 6 different chests, with the chance to add 1 out 15 items to your collection.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n8 Dealers, 8 Buildings, 6 Upgrades, 8 Money laundering options, 6 Crates, 15 Items and more.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has 24 hours offline progression, which is only half as efficient.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn optional ActionPoin(AP) system, which promotes active play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is free and has no microtransactions. The only real money related thing are the DLCs. Those give some early game advantages. All content is available to free and DLC players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll older versions of the game are available under the betas tab and will remain playable.",
    "about_the_game": "Drugs and Crime Idle is a free, offline, idle game about selling drugs and building your criminal empire.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nProduce drugs and upgrade your dealers. Attack with your thugs and generate CrimeCoin, which you can spend on opening 6 different chests, with the chance to add 1 out 15 items to your collection.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n8 Dealers, 8 Buildings, 6 Upgrades, 8 Money laundering options, 6 Crates, 15 Items and more.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has 24 hours offline progression, which is only half as efficient.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAn optional ActionPoin(AP) system, which promotes active play.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game is free and has no microtransactions. The only real money related thing are the DLCs. Those give some early game advantages. All content is available to free and DLC players.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll older versions of the game are available under the betas tab and will remain playable.",
    "short_description": "Behind every great fortune, lies a great crime! Sell drugs, attack with your gang, gamble your CrimeCoins away and hope, that you get that rare item, finally. Free-to-play. Offline Progression. No Microtransactions except 2 optional DLCs.",
